<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Visitor credits · After Hours</title></head>
<body><main><a href="/">← Back to the diner</a><h1>Friends at the door.</h1><p>A small thank-you to the artists behind our surprise visitors.</p><article><h2>Pikachu</h2><p><a href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/pikachu-c22dab8fc3064c76a0c502d64555a74f">Pikachu</a> by <a href="https://sketchfab.com/jacobjksn42">jacobjksn42</a>, licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.</p><p>Scale, orientation, and lighting adapted for this scene. Pokémon character rights belong to their respective owners.</p></article>
<article><h2>Link</h2><p><a href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/link-breath-of-the-wild-32679eadce9f4b51a507aa5d6f03b1c5">Link (Breath of the Wild)</a> by <a href="https://sketchfab.com/oscar3dmodel">雨宮レン</a>, licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.</p><p>Materials converted, arms posed, loose equipment removed, and textures compressed. The Legend of Zelda character rights belong to Nintendo.</p></article>
<article><h2>Eye of Cthulhu</h2><p><a href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/eye-of-cthulhu-rig-06664c90cf3e4d24a74a43dc771ae74f">Eye of Cthulhu Rig</a> by <a href="https://sketchfab.com/NO.DONT.EAT.ME.CASEOH">NO DONT EAT ME CASEOH (Ferris wheel)</a>, licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.</p><p>Opaque cornea removed, static pose saved, and textures compressed. Terraria character rights belong to Re-Logic.</p></article></main></body></html>
<style>body{margin:0;background:#1b211e;color:#e1d4b8;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.7}main{max-width:640px;margin:12vh auto;padding:28px}h1,h2{font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-weight:400}h1{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:.3em}h2{font-size:2rem}article{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid #e1d4b830}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}p{opacity:.8}</style>
